        <mxCell id="a19" value="&lt;b&gt;The asymmetry.&lt;/b&gt; The phenotype is read directly. The genotype never is: it is INFERRED from sparse observations as a mosaic of two known genomes. Panel b is that inference; panels d and e are what it costs." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=3;spacingRight=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="518" y="18" width="176" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
